WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.126 --> 00:00:09.211
Dongsuk.

2
00:00:09.294 --> 00:00:11.463
Why do we make it so complicated?

3
00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:13.590
We can just kill them there.

4
00:00:14.591 --> 00:00:16.343
Are you an idiot?

5
00:00:16.426 --> 00:00:20.097
If we do it there and wake up that spider.
how will we take the mana crystal?

6
00:00:20.722 --> 00:00:23.517
I don't care what his nickname is.

7
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.228
An E-Rank hunter and a D-Rank hunter
without combat experience

8
00:00:26.311 --> 00:00:28.021
will never defeat that Boss.

9
00:00:28.522 --> 00:00:31.358
We wait for that spider
to eat them and fall asleep again.

10
00:00:31.441 --> 00:00:33.276
Then we can take the mana crystal out.

11
00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:36.071
Do we blast it open again
with flash magic?

12
00:00:36.154 --> 00:00:38.615
That'll wake up the spider again.

13
00:00:40.742 --> 00:00:42.619
<i>There's a small path above the cave.</i>

14
00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:44.663
We go down from there.

15
00:00:45.163 --> 00:00:46.915
I see.

16
00:00:46.998 --> 00:00:48.667
You are a genius. Dongsuk.

17
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.460
But will it fall asleep?

18
00:00:50.544 --> 00:00:53.797
If it doesn't. we'll have to take it down.

19
00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.799
<i>That guy's name is Yoo Jinho. right?</i>

20
00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:57.801
<i>Did you see his equipment?</i>

21
00:00:57.884 --> 00:01:00.345
<i>Just the sword and shield alone
are worth hundreds of millions.</i>

22
00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:04.808
<i>If we can't take the mana crystal.
we'll take his belongings instead.</i>

23
00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:08.520
Let me see which wealthy family he's from.

24
00:01:08.603 --> 00:01:11.189
At least we should attend the funeral.

25
00:01:11.273 --> 00:01:12.566
By the way.

26
00:01:12.649 --> 00:01:18.030
the noise we made when sealing the road
must have infuriated that Boss a lot.

27
00:01:18.822 --> 00:01:19.990
Kyuhwan.

28
00:01:20.073 --> 00:01:22.868
Do you think you can
kill that beast by yourself?

29
00:01:22.951 --> 00:01:25.746
How could I possibly do that?

30
00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:27.748
Honestly. me neither.

31
00:01:27.831 --> 00:01:30.083
Boss in Dungeon cannot be underestimated.

32
00:01:32.252 --> 00:01:34.838
In other words. those two

33
00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:38.425
can't possibly leave there alive.

34
00:01:39.134 --> 00:01:40.427
Please wait.

35
00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.180
At least a B-Rank hunter
can defeat a C-Rank Boss alone.

36
00:01:43.263 --> 00:01:46.475
Or a top-tier C-Rank hunter.

37
00:01:46.558 --> 00:01:48.226
Jinwoo. you can't do it...

38
00:01:49.352 --> 00:01:51.146
Let's find a way to get out.

39
00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.815
<i>Jinho is right.</i>

40
00:01:53.899 --> 00:01:57.152
<i>Even though I've had a second awakening
and leveled up.</i>

41
00:01:57.235 --> 00:01:58.862
<i>I am still very weak now.</i>

42
00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:03.617
<i>The Venom-Fanged Kasaka
in the instance dungeon</i>

43
00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:05.118
<i>should be D-Rank.</i>

44
00:02:05.869 --> 00:02:08.705
<i>That Golem Boss is
probably D-Rank or lower.</i>

45
00:02:10.415 --> 00:02:14.586
<i>This Boss is worlds apart from those.</i>

46
00:02:15.962 --> 00:02:17.255
<i>But why?</i>

47
00:02:18.673 --> 00:02:20.926
<i>I can't feel any pressure
that would frustrate me.</i>

48
00:02:22.094 --> 00:02:26.556
<i>I've become strong enough
to no longer fear a C-Rank Boss.</i>

49
00:02:28.475 --> 00:02:30.227
<i>My current level is 18.</i>

50
00:02:32.562 --> 00:02:34.397
<i>Against a C-Rank Boss...</i>

51
00:02:36.817 --> 00:02:38.151
<i>I have a chance of fighting it.</i>

52
00:02:43.114 --> 00:02:45.784
<i>Hunters are called hunters</i>

53
00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.454
<i>because the real hunt begins now.</i>

54
00:04:29.221 --> 00:04:30.555
You've worked hard.

55
00:04:31.514 --> 00:04:35.936
Government officials. media.
and energy-related groups.

56
00:04:36.019 --> 00:04:39.356
Having meetings with them for days
in a row is truly exhausting.

57
00:04:40.315 --> 00:04:43.860
I've never been good at
beating around the bush.

58
00:04:47.614 --> 00:04:50.700
I heard you have no plans coming up.

59
00:04:51.368 --> 00:04:54.663
If possible. could I ask you
for a sparring match?

60
00:04:55.664 --> 00:04:57.874
Perhaps it could change your mood.

61
00:05:01.461 --> 00:05:03.421
I am already a withered veteran...

62
00:05:04.464 --> 00:05:08.343
But how can I refuse when
a young person seeks my guidance?

63
00:05:17.894 --> 00:05:19.354
<i>Its hide is very hard.</i>

64
00:05:23.024 --> 00:05:24.943
<i>Its attack is surprisingly powerful.</i>

65
00:05:25.026 --> 00:05:26.403
<i>If I took one hit. I would be dead.</i>

66
00:05:33.201 --> 00:05:34.577
That kind of move...

67
00:05:34.661 --> 00:05:36.329
He is definitely not an E-Rank hunter.

68
00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.498
<i>Who is he?</i>

69
00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:41.793
<i>Is he...</i>

70
00:05:41.876 --> 00:05:43.378
<i>a False Ranker?</i>

71
00:05:44.004 --> 00:05:45.380
<i>I've heard about them.</i>

72
00:05:45.964 --> 00:05:50.135
<i>Very few hunters can control their magic
power to deliberately get a lower rating.</i>

73
00:05:50.218 --> 00:05:53.388
<i>They are called False Rankers.</i>

74
00:05:53.471 --> 00:05:55.557
<i>And they are usually</i>

75
00:05:56.224 --> 00:05:58.435
<i>psychopaths who take pleasure in killing.</i>

76
00:06:01.688 --> 00:06:04.190
<i>Why did I come here?</i>

77
00:06:04.691 --> 00:06:06.359
<i>Dad...</i>

78
00:06:12.365 --> 00:06:13.241
<i>Damn it.</i>

79
00:06:13.324 --> 00:06:15.618
<i>Its hide is too hard.
I can't harm it at all.</i>

80
00:06:16.703 --> 00:06:17.829
<i>My fatigue...</i>

81
00:06:18.705 --> 00:06:20.665
<i>If it keeps increasing.
it will slow me down.</i>

82
00:06:21.374 --> 00:06:23.501
<i>I need to get rid of it
before that happens.</i>

83
00:06:24.627 --> 00:06:25.462
<i>Paralysis and drain.</i>

84
00:06:26.171 --> 00:06:28.923
<i>This dagger's special
abilities are key to victory.</i>

85
00:06:29.591 --> 00:06:31.634
<i>It'll take effect if I hit its weak spot.</i>

86
00:06:31.718 --> 00:06:32.594
<i>That's the spot!</i>

87
00:06:38.183 --> 00:06:39.434
<i>Acid.</i>

88
00:06:39.517 --> 00:06:41.352
<i>It had this trick too.</i>

89
00:06:42.187 --> 00:06:44.022
<i>Tough hide and the strong acid.</i>

90
00:06:44.105 --> 00:06:46.566
<i>It's tougher to deal with than I expected.</i>

91
00:06:47.525 --> 00:06:49.778
<i>If this continues.
I have no chance of winning.</i>

92
00:06:50.862 --> 00:06:53.698
<i>I have to close the distance between us.</i>

93
00:06:54.532 --> 00:06:56.034
<i>The new skill Dash.</i>

94
00:06:56.826 --> 00:06:59.454
<i>Use this move to get to it.</i>

95
00:07:12.926 --> 00:07:14.928
<i>If it doesn't work once.</i>

96
00:07:15.011 --> 00:07:17.305
<i>Then I'll try again!</i>

97
00:07:18.723 --> 00:07:20.809
<i>He's so fast.</i>

98
00:07:20.892 --> 00:07:23.019
<i>But can his vitality hold up?</i>

99
00:07:23.978 --> 00:07:25.271
<i>What on earth is he planning?</i>

100
00:07:28.149 --> 00:07:29.359
<i>Faster.</i>

101
00:07:31.111 --> 00:07:32.821
<i>Even faster.</i>

102
00:07:35.323 --> 00:07:36.908
<i>Almost there...</i>

103
00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.831
Jinwoo!

104
00:08:01.182 --> 00:08:02.183
Jinwoo!

105
00:08:47.854 --> 00:08:52.525
<i>Thankfully I didn't claim
the rewards for the daily quest.</i>

106
00:08:53.109 --> 00:08:55.487
<i>Otherwise. I can't even
imagine the consequences.</i>

107
00:08:57.906 --> 00:08:59.532
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

108
00:08:59.616 --> 00:09:02.202
<i>He defeated the Boss all by himself.</i>

109
00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.829
<i>There's no mistake.</i>

110
00:09:05.455 --> 00:09:07.999
<i>He's a False Ranker.</i>

111
00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:11.419
How much is this worth?

112
00:09:12.295 --> 00:09:13.421
Well...

113
00:09:13.505 --> 00:09:14.881
Sir.

114
00:09:15.757 --> 00:09:18.927
Do you need me to help
you with the magic gem?

115
00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:21.596
I can carry the luggage too.

116
00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:25.475
Have some water. sir.

117
00:09:25.558 --> 00:09:27.227
Thank...

118
00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.354
Why is he suddenly calling me that?

119
00:09:29.938 --> 00:09:31.564
Please take a rest. sir.

120
00:09:31.648 --> 00:09:34.359
I'll mine the mana crystal.

121
00:09:35.902 --> 00:09:38.321
<i>What's with this kid?</i>

122
00:09:40.573 --> 00:09:42.367
They are still alive.

123
00:10:02.762 --> 00:10:04.138
Are you okay?

124
00:10:04.222 --> 00:10:05.223
Yes.

125
00:10:05.306 --> 00:10:07.100
Thank you for your guidance.

126
00:10:07.684 --> 00:10:10.937
I've relaxed a lot.

127
00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.313
Thank you.

128
00:10:12.939 --> 00:10:14.274
You are amazing. president.

129
00:10:14.357 --> 00:10:16.568
There's no sign of decline in your skills.

130
00:10:16.651 --> 00:10:20.280
No. I'm no longer as good as I used to be.

131
00:10:21.114 --> 00:10:24.200
Jinchul. your moves have improved.

132
00:10:24.284 --> 00:10:26.077
It seems you've done a lot of training.

133
00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:31.624
Training can't increase hunters' level.
but it can improve their skills.

134
00:10:31.708 --> 00:10:33.126
Hmm.

135
00:10:33.209 --> 00:10:35.336
{\an8}Don't take pride in the hunter's strength.

136
00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:38.298
{\an8}Having a physical and mind training
is indeed important.

137
00:10:38.381 --> 00:10:42.093
{\an8}Especially if you're going to
a dangerous place like a dungeon.

138
00:10:42.719 --> 00:10:44.596
{\an8}After all. in such places.

139
00:10:44.679 --> 00:10:49.475
<i>you see the worst of people.</i>

140
00:10:50.059 --> 00:10:51.352
Is the Boss dead?

141
00:10:51.436 --> 00:10:53.521
This spider is all bark and no bite.

142
00:10:53.605 --> 00:10:54.689
What a crap.

143
00:10:55.273 --> 00:10:58.484
With his equipment. defeating
a C-Rank Boss isn't impossible.

144
00:10:58.568 --> 00:11:02.405
Even so. it's embarrassing
to lose to a D-Rank hunter.

145
00:11:02.989 --> 00:11:04.949
Dongsuk. what should we do?

146
00:11:05.033 --> 00:11:06.618
What else?

147
00:11:07.201 --> 00:11:08.328
Yoo Jinho.

148
00:11:08.953 --> 00:11:11.080
I looked you up because of
your expensive equipment.

149
00:11:11.164 --> 00:11:12.582
You are no ordinary person.

150
00:11:13.249 --> 00:11:16.336
The president of
Yoojin Construction. Yoo Myunghan.

151
00:11:16.419 --> 00:11:18.046
He's your dad. right?

152
00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:20.923
So what?

153
00:11:21.007 --> 00:11:22.717
I'll give you a chance.

154
00:11:23.843 --> 00:11:25.219
Kill Sung Jinwoo.

155
00:11:25.303 --> 00:11:26.679
Eh?

156
00:11:26.763 --> 00:11:28.890
You know what we do. right?

157
00:11:28.973 --> 00:11:32.393
We kill those useless ones
who just come to fill numbers

158
00:11:32.477 --> 00:11:34.103
to take the spoils for ourselves.

159
00:11:34.187 --> 00:11:35.313
Yoo Jinho.

160
00:11:35.396 --> 00:11:37.565
I want you to be our accomplice.

161
00:11:37.648 --> 00:11:39.567
If you do. I'll spare you.

162
00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:40.902
How can I...

163
00:11:41.486 --> 00:11:44.989
<i>That young master killed a C-Rank BOSS
on his own with that equipment.</i>

164
00:11:45.573 --> 00:11:47.825
<i>It'll be troublesome
if that equipment has special effects.</i>

165
00:11:48.326 --> 00:11:51.871
If you refuse. you can die together.

166
00:11:53.164 --> 00:11:54.123
What's wrong?

167
00:11:54.207 --> 00:11:56.209
What's there to hesitate about?

168
00:11:56.292 --> 00:11:58.628
No one will know what happened here.

169
00:11:59.128 --> 00:12:03.132
Are you afraid of that E-Rank trash?

170
00:12:19.941 --> 00:12:20.775
Huh?

171
00:12:21.692 --> 00:12:22.527
What?

172
00:12:23.569 --> 00:12:25.571
Are you taking his side?

173
00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.119
Dongsuk. what do we do now?

174
00:12:31.202 --> 00:12:32.870
You start with the weaker one.

175
00:12:33.913 --> 00:12:34.914
Have you two

176
00:12:35.957 --> 00:12:39.043
ever killed people?

177
00:12:43.923 --> 00:12:45.299
<i>Urgent quest?</i>

178
00:12:46.008 --> 00:12:47.301
<i>What's going on?</i>

179
00:12:48.386 --> 00:12:50.638
Pay attention here.

180
00:12:50.721 --> 00:12:51.764
Take this!

181
00:12:59.355 --> 00:13:00.273
Jinwoo!

182
00:13:06.237 --> 00:13:07.447
Heejin.

183
00:13:11.325 --> 00:13:12.702
Long time no see.

184
00:13:12.785 --> 00:13:15.788
What's going on
at the White Tiger Guild lately?

185
00:13:15.872 --> 00:13:17.248
Nothing much.

186
00:13:17.331 --> 00:13:18.916
It's the same as usual.

187
00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.169
How about your Hunters Guild. Gina?

188
00:13:21.252 --> 00:13:23.754
The same as usual too.

189
00:13:24.255 --> 00:13:29.302
By the way. you went to Hunter Cha's
A-Rank dungeon training. right?

190
00:13:29.385 --> 00:13:30.636
How did it go?

191
00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:32.388
It was awesome.

192
00:13:32.472 --> 00:13:33.806
It ended in an instant.

193
00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:37.477
<i>Those A-Rank magic beasts
we struggled with</i>

194
00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:43.983
<i>were instantly taken down by her.</i>

195
00:13:45.359 --> 00:13:48.112
<i>She defeated enemies effortlessly.</i>

196
00:13:48.196 --> 00:13:50.448
<i>Needless to say. we were surprised.</i>

197
00:13:50.531 --> 00:13:52.992
<i>Kihoon was quite shocked.</i>

198
00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:57.246
Because his goal was to
become the next Captain.

199
00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.415
Someone who works as hard
as he would be more shocked.

200
00:13:59.499 --> 00:14:03.169
What about your Kim Chul?
Doesn't he have the same goal?

201
00:14:03.252 --> 00:14:04.587
He also wants to be the Captain.

202
00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.131
He's not a bad guy...

203
00:14:07.215 --> 00:14:09.842
That says it all.

204
00:14:10.384 --> 00:14:13.763
But after all. we are pretty lucky

205
00:14:13.846 --> 00:14:18.351
as we are able to join large guilds
like Hunters Guild and White Tiger Guild.

206
00:14:18.434 --> 00:14:19.727
That's true.

207
00:14:19.811 --> 00:14:20.728
Hmm.

208
00:14:20.812 --> 00:14:25.566
After all. there are ominous
rumors in some places.

209
00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:27.235
Ominous rumors?

210
00:14:27.735 --> 00:14:30.780
The teams with
an abnormally high casualty rate.

211
00:14:30.863 --> 00:14:31.864
Something like that.

212
00:14:35.326 --> 00:14:38.079
Yoo Jinho. he's dead.

213
00:14:40.122 --> 00:14:41.457
How can you do that?

214
00:14:44.001 --> 00:14:46.045
<i>How could I forget?</i>

215
00:14:46.754 --> 00:14:49.924
<i>This is a place that believes
in the survival of the fittest.</i>

216
00:14:50.633 --> 00:14:54.011
<i>a place full of violence and deceit.</i>

217
00:14:55.221 --> 00:14:59.934
<i>How could I...</i>

218
00:15:00.017 --> 00:15:05.398
<i>How could I...</i>

219
00:15:06.607 --> 00:15:08.067
<i>I see.</i>

220
00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.902
<i>I've become numb.</i>

221
00:15:10.736 --> 00:15:14.156
<i>careless. arrogant. and deluded.</i>

222
00:15:17.159 --> 00:15:18.327
<i>Enemies.</i>

223
00:15:18.911 --> 00:15:21.873
<i>The system is forcing me to kill people.</i>

224
00:15:23.499 --> 00:15:25.960
<i>Does that mean it doesn't want me to die?</i>

225
00:15:27.712 --> 00:15:30.214
<i>This is neither coincidence nor kindness.</i>

226
00:15:31.757 --> 00:15:34.218
<i>The system needs me.</i>

227
00:15:38.848 --> 00:15:40.558
<i>I must be strong.</i>

228
00:15:41.851 --> 00:15:43.436
Thank goodness.

229
00:15:44.145 --> 00:15:46.731
Hey. he's still alive.

230
00:15:48.691 --> 00:15:49.817
I see.

231
00:15:51.986 --> 00:15:54.530
The system is using me.

232
00:15:55.031 --> 00:15:57.408
And I am using the system too.

233
00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.786
Hey. Kyuhwan. don't hold back.

234
00:16:02.413 --> 00:16:03.873
How could I forget?

235
00:16:04.624 --> 00:16:06.667
The weak will have
everything taken from them.

236
00:16:06.751 --> 00:16:08.544
This place is just like that.

237
00:16:08.628 --> 00:16:10.296
You understand it very well.

238
00:16:10.379 --> 00:16:13.007
The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind.

239
00:16:13.591 --> 00:16:14.759
That means...

240
00:16:14.842 --> 00:16:18.012
You are also mentally prepared. right?

241
00:16:18.596 --> 00:16:19.597
What?

242
00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.182
What are you saying?

243
00:16:21.265 --> 00:16:23.267
I'm asking

244
00:16:24.894 --> 00:16:28.731
{\an8}whether you are also
prepared to be hunted.

245
00:16:30.274 --> 00:16:32.902
Dongsuk. let me do it.

246
00:16:32.985 --> 00:16:34.612
Buddy.

247
00:16:34.695 --> 00:16:37.949
It seems like you don't quite
understand the situation.

248
00:16:38.032 --> 00:16:39.867
Mentally prepared to be hunted?

249
00:16:39.951 --> 00:16:43.412
What can a boastful E-Rank hunter do?

250
00:16:43.496 --> 00:16:45.581
The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind.

251
00:16:58.177 --> 00:16:59.553
The first one.

252
00:16:59.637 --> 00:17:00.930
Jun... Juntae.

253
00:17:01.013 --> 00:17:01.889
No way.

254
00:17:01.973 --> 00:17:03.766
When did he have a weapon in his hand?

255
00:17:03.849 --> 00:17:05.851
Where did he hide it?

256
00:17:05.935 --> 00:17:08.854
<i>Even if he was careless.
Juntae was still a D-Rank hunter.</i>

257
00:17:08.938 --> 00:17:11.148
<i>How could an E-Rank hunter
manage to kill him?</i>

258
00:17:14.485 --> 00:17:16.487
<i>I killed someone...</i>

259
00:17:17.071 --> 00:17:17.947
<i>I killed...</i>

260
00:17:18.906 --> 00:17:22.368
<i>I am following the system's instructions.</i>

261
00:17:22.952 --> 00:17:23.953
<i>but the fact is</i>

262
00:17:24.662 --> 00:17:26.372
<i>I killed someone.</i>

263
00:17:27.581 --> 00:17:29.834
<i>But if I don't. I will be the one to die.</i>

264
00:17:31.002 --> 00:17:33.295
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

265
00:17:34.463 --> 00:17:37.466
<i>Since only the strong can survive...</i>

266
00:17:38.551 --> 00:17:39.969
Go to hell!

267
00:17:40.845 --> 00:17:42.179
- Die!
- Die!

268
00:17:49.645 --> 00:17:50.479
Huh?

269
00:17:50.563 --> 00:17:53.065
How can an E-Rank hunter have such skills?

270
00:17:53.566 --> 00:17:55.317
You bad guy...

271
00:18:00.531 --> 00:18:01.365
Kyuhwan!

272
00:18:01.449 --> 00:18:02.867
Yes.

273
00:18:09.665 --> 00:18:11.208
Take this!

274
00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:20.092
So strong.

275
00:18:21.093 --> 00:18:25.056
<i>I think he's even stronger
than he was when fighting the Boss.</i>

276
00:18:25.139 --> 00:18:28.267
You wiped out
my team members in an instant.

277
00:18:28.809 --> 00:18:30.770
You've been hiding your ability.

278
00:18:31.353 --> 00:18:33.314
You defeated the Boss too. didn't you?

279
00:18:34.148 --> 00:18:36.108
But even if I'm also a C-Rank hunter.

280
00:18:36.192 --> 00:18:38.360
I'm not the same as them.

281
00:18:38.986 --> 00:18:40.696
Enhancement!

282
00:18:44.825 --> 00:18:46.827
<i>Even if he is as strong as a demon.</i>

283
00:18:46.911 --> 00:18:50.915
<i>he must be exhausted after
fighting the Boss and five hunters.</i>

284
00:18:51.415 --> 00:18:55.211
<i>He relies on his speed and
the special abilities of that dagger.</i>

285
00:18:55.795 --> 00:18:58.923
<i>But my enhanced body is as hard as steel.</i>

286
00:18:59.006 --> 00:19:00.674
<i>Your dagger</i>

287
00:19:00.758 --> 00:19:01.634
<i>won't work on me.</i>

288
00:19:03.344 --> 00:19:04.720
Take this!

289
00:19:07.056 --> 00:19:08.182
Captain Hwang.

290
00:19:08.265 --> 00:19:09.391
You are very strong.

291
00:19:11.018 --> 00:19:13.687
But let me tell you something.

292
00:19:18.484 --> 00:19:19.443
That is...

293
00:19:20.027 --> 00:19:21.904
I am always leveling up.

294
00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:25.658
<i>What... What happened?</i>

295
00:19:25.741 --> 00:19:28.744
<i>He... He knocked me to the ground.</i>

296
00:19:29.453 --> 00:19:30.579
<i>This guy</i>

297
00:19:30.663 --> 00:19:33.040
<i>is no way an E-Rank hunter.</i>

298
00:19:34.166 --> 00:19:36.168
Wait! Don't kill me.

299
00:19:36.252 --> 00:19:37.086
Please spare me.

300
00:19:37.169 --> 00:19:38.796
Money... I'll give you money.

301
00:19:38.879 --> 00:19:40.881
All the Mana Crystals and Magic Gems here.

302
00:19:40.965 --> 00:19:42.591
You keep all of them.

303
00:19:43.509 --> 00:19:44.927
Is it not enough?

304
00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:45.845
I understand.

305
00:19:45.928 --> 00:19:48.013
I'll double the money for you.

306
00:19:48.097 --> 00:19:49.265
- I'll pay...
- Three times...

307
00:19:50.266 --> 00:19:52.768
You tried to kill me three times.

308
00:19:53.936 --> 00:19:55.688
Are you begging me to spare your life?

309
00:19:55.771 --> 00:19:57.356
Stop... stop!

310
00:19:57.439 --> 00:19:59.650
Do you think you can get away with this?

311
00:20:00.359 --> 00:20:03.362
No one will know what
happened in the dungeon.

312
00:20:04.155 --> 00:20:05.114
You said it.

313
00:20:06.615 --> 00:20:07.950
{\an8}Bad guy!

314
00:20:08.033 --> 00:20:09.910
{\an8}Do you know who my brother is...

315
00:20:25.718 --> 00:20:27.761
After the Boss dies.
the dungeon will begin to close.

316
00:20:27.845 --> 00:20:28.846
Let's get out quickly.

317
00:20:34.018 --> 00:20:35.311
Hmm...

318
00:20:35.853 --> 00:20:38.814
All C-Rank hunters have perished.

319
00:20:38.898 --> 00:20:44.403
The survivors are
a D-Rank hunter and an E-Rank hunter?

320
00:20:44.486 --> 00:20:46.238
That's right.

321
00:20:46.322 --> 00:20:47.364
Well...

322
00:20:48.574 --> 00:20:49.450
You.

323
00:20:49.533 --> 00:20:50.743
Yes.

324
00:20:50.826 --> 00:20:52.286
That sword in your hand

325
00:20:52.369 --> 00:20:54.371
is the Claymore Kallion
from the Maya Company. right?

326
00:20:54.455 --> 00:20:56.332
It just hit the market.

327
00:20:56.415 --> 00:20:57.666
Yeah.

328
00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.878
<i>I didn't know there'd be rewards too.</i>

329
00:21:00.961 --> 00:21:03.088
<i>Skill: Murderous Intent.</i>

330
00:21:04.882 --> 00:21:07.801
<i>All abilities are halved?</i>

331
00:21:07.885 --> 00:21:08.886
I see.

332
00:21:08.969 --> 00:21:10.971
If you are using that equipment.
I can understand.

333
00:21:11.805 --> 00:21:17.311
You defeated the Boss alone
and this E-Rank hunter hid away. right?

334
00:21:19.813 --> 00:21:23.776
Thank you for your help today.

335
00:21:23.859 --> 00:21:25.736
The investigation ends here.

336
00:21:26.987 --> 00:21:28.197
Well...

337
00:21:29.448 --> 00:21:32.826
Thank you. sir.

338
00:21:34.078 --> 00:21:34.912
Hmm.

339
00:21:42.169 --> 00:21:43.087
Is something wrong?

340
00:21:44.088 --> 00:21:44.922
No.

341
00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:50.219
I was just thinking
thankfully I had her take an umbrella.
